{#
  Gel Overlay Atom - SVG-masked background element with corner manipulation

  ARCHITECTURE:
  - gel.njk: Renders DOM element with ID and color class
  - Gel.js: Controls SVG polygon mask and corner animation
  - GelAnimationManager: Initializes and coordinates multiple gels on scroll
  - GelManipulator: Positions gel relative to viewport or reference element

  ELEMENT IDS AND CONFIGURATION:
  - Element ID must match arrangement keys used by gel choreography (e.g., id="bg-gel-0")
  - IDs use kebab-case format: bg-gel-0, bg-gel-1, bg-gel-2
  - .gel class triggers automatic discovery during initialization

  GRADIENT CLASSES (defined in styles/backgrounds/Gel.css, which lists every name):
  - color, direction and fade each only set a variable read by .gel, so they
    combine in any order. Only color has a default here.
  - color:     gel-<color>, e.g. gel-primary
  - direction: gel-<direction>; the stylesheet default is "to top"
  - fade:      gel-fade-<size> or an arbitrary [value]; the stylesheet default is full
  - Pass the full class name, never a fragment built in the template. Tailwind
    finds classes by reading complete strings, so 'gel-' ~ name would be missed by
    the first dev build, which runs before Eleventy writes _site.
  - Keep full direction and fade names out of this comment. Tailwind scans
    views/ and would ship every class named here to every page.
  - Gel.js swaps the color class at runtime, so color must be one of its
    colorClasses

  USAGE:
  {% import "atoms/gel.njk" as gelAtom %}
  {{ gelAtom.render({ id: 'bg-gel-0', color: 'gel-primary' }) }}
  Add direction: and fade: with a full class name each.

  PARAMETERS:
  - id: Element ID matching gel arrangement entries (required for choreography)
  - color: Colour class (default: 'gel-primary')
  - direction: Direction class (optional)
  - fade: Fade distance class (optional)
#}
{% macro render(params = {}) %}
  {%- set color = params.color | default('gel-primary') -%}
  {%- set direction = params.direction | default('') -%}
  {%- set fade = params.fade | default('') -%}
  {%- set id = params.id | default('gel-default') -%}

  <div id="{{ id }}"
       class="gel absolute inset-0 {{ color }}{% if direction %} {{ direction }}{% endif %}{% if fade %} {{ fade }}{% endif %}"
       aria-hidden="true"></div>

{% endmacro %}
